    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d73">

                <pb facs="0148" n="88" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg88"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr.
                            Uhl</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-06-15"><hi rendition="#italic">June 15,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Riots still occurring in Szechuan. Mission at Chengtu not much damaged. Have
                    asked imperial edict awarding death penalty to rioters. Central Government seems
                    to have lost control over people. No American hurt.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Denby</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
